=== 7. Re-seed to restore fixture + balance-reconciliation invariant ===
$ NEARS_SEED_ALLOW_DB=multi_food_db php artisan db:seed --class=LoyaltyHistoryPaginationSeeder --force
NEARS-2153 loyalty history pagination test data ready (user_id=6): 29 total rows

$ mysql -u root multi_food_db -e "SELECT loyalty_point FROM users WHERE id=6;"
loyalty_point: 0.000

$ mysql -u root multi_food_db -e "SELECT reference, credit, balance FROM loyalty_point_transactions
   WHERE user_id=6 AND reference LIKE 'nears2153-%' ORDER BY created_at ASC LIMIT 1;"
first row: nears2153-order_place-0, credit 25.000, balance 25.000

$ mysql -u root multi_food_db -e "SELECT reference, credit, balance FROM loyalty_point_transactions
   WHERE user_id=6 AND reference LIKE 'nears2153-%' ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT 1;"
last row: nears2153-order_place-24, credit 21.000, balance 742.000

Invariant per code (run(), lines 93/102): $runningBalance starts at users.loyalty_point
and advances by every row's credit each loop iteration regardless of the idempotency
skip. Sum of all 25 seeded credits = 742.000.
  users.loyalty_point (0.000) + sum(seeded credits, 742.000) = 742.000
  == last transaction row's cumulative balance (742.000)      MATCH
First row also checks out: 0.000 + 25.000 = 25.000 == first row balance (25.000). MATCH
=> Balance reconciliation invariant HOLDS.

$ mysql -u root multi_food_db -e "SELECT COUNT(*) total, COUNT(DISTINCT reference) distinct_refs
   FROM loyalty_point_transactions WHERE user_id=6;"
total: 29  distinct_refs: 29   -- no dupes after restore
$ mysql -u root multi_food_db -e "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM loyalty_point_transactions WHERE user_id=3;"
3   -- control still untouched

